r","/prf"]],"story":"<p class=\"prf-lede prf-story\">As of Oct 12, the record for Hancock County runs from 1951 to 2025, and on the middle value of the county&rsquo;s 9 grids November to December came in under 90% of normal in 38 of 75 years. In 2025 the middle of the grids had June to July at 181% of normal and September to October at 62% of normal. Grid 27747 had its driest year in 1958 at 51% of normal.</p>"}
